  "ruleText": "Mid 103.01 Composition of the Council. The council consists of 6 members appointed pursuant to, and meeting the eligibility requirements of, RSA 326-D:3, I.\n\nSource. #7412, eff 12-5-00; ss by #14496, eff 2-8-26",
